        <div class="update-card__image1"></div>
        <div class="update-card__body">
          <h3 class="update-card__title">Computer Science</h3>
          <p class="update-card__desc">The study of computation, algorithms, software, and computer systems.</p>
          <a href="#computer-science-section" class="button__ghost">Learn More</a>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="update-card2">
