The Data Science major leads to the Bachelor of Science degree and requires a minimum of 48 semester credit hours. To graduate with a major in Data Science, a student must have an earned GPA of at least 2.0 in required Data Science and other courses presented for the major. At most one of the foundation courses (CMPSC 100, CMPSC 101, or CMPSC 105) may be presented for the major on the Credit/No Credit grade basis.</p>
